{
  "_comment": "Generated from data/case_tables dialogue CSV.",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "……你就是那个同船的公子？我叫周德茂，做布匹生意。这次是去武昌府进一批棉布。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "周老板是做什么生意的？",
          "goto": "ask_business",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "为什么选夜船？",
          "goto": "ask_night_ferry",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "介绍夜船的那个朋友是谁？",
          "goto": "ask_friend",
          "type": "press",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_route_note_checked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_zhou_talked"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵跟了你多久？",
          "goto": "ask_servant",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "看看船舱里有什么",
          "goto": "observe_cabin",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "夜深了，整理疑点",
          "goto": "sleep_review",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_agui_talked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_lao_fan_talked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_zhou_talked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_seal_box_checked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_route_note_checked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_storm_window_checked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_wet_cloak_checked"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "cabin_review_done"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_business": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "不算大。就是混口饭吃。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "这次是去武昌府进一批棉布，过了年好卖。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "周老板谦虚了。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_night_ferry": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "急着赶路。武昌的早市不能错过。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "夜船快。半天就到。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "夜船危险。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "我知道。但时间不等人。而且……有人告诉我这条路快。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "他顿了顿，像是在斟酌用词",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "一个朋友介绍的。说这条船靠谱，船家跑了二十年。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "什么朋友？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "……名字记不太清了。做生意的。以前在石矶渡碰过面。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_friend": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked",
        "cabin_friend_pressed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "你说有个朋友介绍这条夜船。做生意的人，连介绍人名字都记不清？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "萍水相逢罢了。石矶渡来往客多，我哪能个个记住。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "但你记住了他推荐的船。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "因为他讲得准。船家老范，东汊快，半日能到。做买卖的人听见快字，总会多信几分。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "周德茂证言：介绍人",
          "record_text": "周德茂称介绍夜船的人只是石矶渡偶遇的生意朋友，名字记不清，但对方准确说出了老范和东汊路线。",
          "record_id": "record_cabin_zhou_friend"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_servant": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "阿贵跟了我十二年。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "十六岁进的门。什么都不会——是我手把手教的。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年了……不短了。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年……确实不短。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "observe_cabin": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_observed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "船舱不大，但收拾得还算干净。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "舱壁上挂着一根铁撬棍，旁边是蓑衣和斗笠。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "角落有几只木箱，用麻绳捆着。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "铁撬棍的位置有点奇怪——挂在舱壁正中间，像是特意放在那里的。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "这铁撬棍放得倒显眼……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "sleep_review": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "雨声压着舱板，灯火在木壁上晃。你把今夜见过的东西一件件放回脑中。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "官印木匣、行程简记、湿斗篷、窗外风浪，还有周老板那个说不清的朋友。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "最不该忽略的是哪一点？",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "路线和天气都不对",
          "goto": "review_route",
          "type": "reason"
        },
        {
          "text": "湿斗篷和门缝不对",
          "goto": "review_cloak",
          "type": "reason"
        },
        {
          "text": "周老板说的朋友不对",
          "goto": "review_friend",
          "type": "reason"
        },
        {
          "text": "官印木匣必须记牢",
          "goto": "review_seal",
          "type": "reason"
        }
      ]
    },
    "review_route": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_review_done",
        "cabin_review_route"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "平水驿、夜船、东汊、风雨。几件事合在一起，像有人把我和周德茂都推上了同一条路。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "record_type": "key",
          "record_title": "推理札记：夜船路线",
          "record_text": "行程简记与风雨相互印证。这趟船不是单纯赶路，路线和时机都可能被人提前安排过。",
          "record_id": "record_cabin_review_route"
        },
        {
          "text": "你把行程简记夹进内袋。船身在雨夜里轻轻一顿，像是擦过了什么硬物。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "睡下",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "review_cloak": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_review_done",
        "cabin_review_cloak"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "斗篷湿得不对。若只是门缝进风，不该在斗篷下积出那样一摊水。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "record_type": "key",
          "record_title": "推理札记：舱门湿痕",
          "record_text": "异常湿斗篷说明陆昭入舱之后，自己的舱门附近可能又发生过进出或翻动。",
          "record_id": "record_cabin_review_cloak"
        },
        {
          "text": "你下意识看向舱门。雨声太重，门外若有人压低脚步，确实很难听见。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "睡下",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "review_friend": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_review_done",
        "cabin_review_friend"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "周德茂急着赶路可以理解。但一个连名字都记不清的人，却能让他改信夜船和东汊。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "record_type": "key",
          "record_title": "推理札记：介绍人",
          "record_text": "周德茂所谓的生意朋友可能不是随口推荐，而是把他引上这条夜船的关键人物。",
          "record_id": "record_cabin_review_friend"
        },
        {
          "text": "你记下“介绍人”三个字。墨色未干，窗外忽然闪过一道白光。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "睡下",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "review_seal": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_review_done",
        "cabin_review_seal"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "官印木匣还在，锁也完好。只要它在，我就还是奉旨南下的巡按。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "record_type": "key",
          "record_title": "推理札记：官印木匣",
          "record_text": "官印木匣此刻仍在陆昭舱中。它是身份凭据，一旦遗失，陆昭会立刻失去自证身份的依凭。",
          "record_id": "record_cabin_review_seal"
        },
        {
          "text": "你又按了一次锁舌。铜锁冰冷，雨夜也冰冷。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "睡下",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
